# Third-party components and trademarks

This repository contains build glue, patches and documentation for running
[SuperTux](https://github.com/SuperTux/supertux) on OpenHarmony / HarmonyOS. It does not
contain third-party sources: `scripts/fetch-sources.ps1` clones them from their own
repositories at the revisions listed in `scripts/versions.txt`.

## Components

| Component | License | How it is used here |
|---|---|---|
| SuperTux | GPL-3.0-or-later | The game being ported. `patches/supertux-ohos.patch` modifies its sources, so anything built from it is covered by the GPL. |
| SDL3 | zlib | Platform layer. `patches/sdl-ohos.patch` contains local changes for this port. |
| SDL3_image, SDL3_ttf | zlib | Image and font loading for SuperTux. |
| PhysFS | zlib | Archive/filesystem layer used by SuperTux. |
| libpng | libpng-2.0 | PNG decoding. |
| FreeType | FTL / GPL-2.0 | Font rasterisation. |
| fmt, glm | MIT | Formatting and math. |
| libogg, libvorbis | BSD-3-Clause | Audio decoding. |
| OpenAL Soft | LGPL-2.0-or-later | Audio output (built with the null/wave backends for now, so it is currently silent). |

SuperTux's own data files (levels, images, music) are covered by its own licensing
(mostly GPL-3.0-or-later and CC-BY-SA); they are fetched with the SuperTux sources and are
not stored in this repository.

